        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"a39e6299-86de-4216-954f-90e2a3d2e68a\",\"review_text\":\"You changed your format. And I don't like\"},{\"review_id\":\"da1d6644-0792-4aa1-94e3-52c44ca1c2f4\",\"review_text\":\"Exceptional sound quality\"},{\"review_id\":\"0a17b60d-ed75-4194-a582-32226ae4b912\",\"review_text\":\"I dont know why my playlist wont play the song i added ? Is this a new feature ? If you are reading this spotify, please change this or help me. Thank You\"},{\"review_id\":\"3903de9a-a340-42ba-8173-e66e4f55ef96\",\"review_text\":\"There is such a great variety of podcasts. Something for everyone.\"},{\"review_id\":\"1274bc7d-1489-4025-98b7-c575b8282436\",\"review_text\":\"You guys took away the basic feature to force people to buy premium plans. Switching to saavn. Bye I hope the loser who came up with the idea gets fired\"},{\"review_id\":\"33304a50-acee-4525-8fd9-5588100db615\",\"review_text\":\"I loved thia app I used it all the time to listen to music but you have to buy preimum to listen better. The thing is you also have to pay I would recommend this but when you listennto songs it gives you so many adds and not even the song you would like to listen\"},{\"review_id\":\"449470e3-4311-4712-8630-d2a83b300c96\",\"review_text\":\"Gapless playback doesn't work between end and beginning of albums, it ruins the experience of certain albums, especially Nonagon Infinity which is meant to infinity loop. Otherwise it's perfect. Also really good for learning lyrics to songs.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7bba48db-deed-432d-bc58-91f1a191ee5a\",\"review_text\":\"omg i love this app so much\"},{\"review_id\":\"bd49704f-7040-4ffd-9298-6087f4f8e6a6\",\"review_text\":\"This app is not Useful, only waste of time, it's Ugly\"},{\"review_id\":\"5051c502-202d-46f0-a247-d10b9f098f98\",\"review_text\":\"🤚👎👎👎👎\"}]}"
